abstract: "Article companion for auditable RGZ tree and one-loop quark-scattering calculations. The author run matches eight reference prefactors and 144 coefficients within the declared domain; the author reports a completed full workflow from an empty cache, with final artifacts rechecked. No third-party independent reproduction is claimed."
